hived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-05-26T09:17:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T20:03:00Z","closed_at":"2026-05-26T19:33:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot master (commit used for PR #119770), reproducible before applying the fix.\n\nAlso reproducible in Godot v4.6.stable.mono.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9649) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14650HX (24 threads) - 31.73 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen `Camera2D.zoom != Vector2(1, 1)`, `Parallax2D` nodes using `repeat_size`\ncan be positioned outside the visible area.\n\nThis happens because `Camera2D` computes `adj_screen_pos` using the full\nviewport size instead of the actual visible world size after zoom is applied.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached MRP project.\n2. Press **Run**.\n\nExpected: repeated tiles cover the visible viewport.\n\nActual: repeated tiles are positioned outside the visible area.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAttached: `mrp.zip`\n\nOpen the project and press **Run**.\n\nThe issue reproduces immediately with `Camera2D.zoom = (3, 3)`.\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28257244/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"bd65-crt","id":271831608,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDPSOA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc